---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { COMPANY } from '../data/company';
---
<Base title="About | 16bit.ink" description="16bit.ink makes small browser games in a pen-and-ink style.">
  <section class="paper-card narrow tape" style="text-align:left">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>16bit.ink is a small studio making browser games in a pen-and-ink style. The ink is drawn by code to look like a ballpoint sketch on paper. The style goes back to school, where games started out as pen drawings in a notebook.</p>
    <p>Every game is free to start. If you enjoy it, you can unlock the rest with a single purchase. There are no ads, no energy timers and no loot boxes.</p>
    <p>16bit.ink is made by {COMPANY.name}, {COMPANY.registered}.</p>
    <p>Questions or a purchase problem? Email <a href={`mailto:${COMPANY.email}`}>{COMPANY.email}</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
